 "headline": "Herro's 50 Can't Save MONSTARS From Themselves",
 "notes": [
  "Tyler Herro dropped 50 points with seven threes for MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f, and they're still down 8-3 to Adam Silver Dez Nuts. Historic waste of a night.",
  "Adam Silver Dez Nuts took 3PT% from MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f while Herro was busy burying seven threes for the other side. Can't make this up.",
  "Thug Life has nine players with a stat line tonight, led by Brunson's 30 and Clingan's 9-11 shooting. Everyone else brought one guy.",
  "Saddiq Bey is 1-11 from the field for Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw, and they still lead 7-4. The 56 points he scored earlier this week are doing the lifting.",
  "Wembanyama put up 42 points and 19 boards for Nova Knicks. Zero Fox Given needs a miracle to survive this."
 ],
